      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Doctor messages and doctor suggestions\nremain temporary.\n\nFull session transcripts, raw audio and\nvideo are not stored in the database.\nLive voice reaches Gemini while connected;\noptional camera sharing requires opt-in.",
      "originalText": "Doctor messages and doctor suggestions\nremain temporary.\n\nFull session transcripts, raw audio and\nvideo are not stored in the database.\nLive voice reaches Gemini while connected;\noptional camera sharing requires opt-in.",
